Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:05.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开你我该怎么办啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would I do without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}No
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.19,0:00:11.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有东西把他转变成了怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something turned him into a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:12.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们面对的是什么  你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we are dealing with, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.94,0:00:14.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔病毒的幸存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Croatoan survivals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.53,0:00:15.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都染上瘟疫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}with plague and pestilence 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.99,0:00:17.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天知道这瘟疫会传多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knows how far this thing can spread?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.65,0:00:21.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是克劳力  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's "Crowley," right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.72,0:00:25.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:28.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这么想路西法死呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}exactly would you want the devil dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.12,0:00:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:30.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果路西法想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Lucifer manages
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:32.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灭了你们人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}to exterminate humankind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.90,0:00:33.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们自然命不久矣了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're next.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:35.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个关路西法的牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cage you sprung lucifer from
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.89,0:00:37.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以再把他扔回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can shove his ass back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:38.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要打开牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The key to the cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.40,0:00:39.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要四个戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:40.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天启四骑士手上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the horsemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.89,0:00:41.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们拿到了战争的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got war's.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.19,0:00:45.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还拿到了饥荒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We nicked famine's.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.03,0:00:48.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有2个戒指了  只要拿到瘟疫和死亡的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's two rings down. Collect all four.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.30,0:00:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就凑齐4枚戒指了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just need pestilence and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:51.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.18,0:00:55.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.71,0:01:06.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是很高兴我们能为患者提供药物了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just glad we got something to offer people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.60,0:01:07.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.37,0:01:10.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过那全是废话  只是为了利益罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a load of crap -- pure profit-driven crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.19,0:01:12.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猪流感  是种流行病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, swine flu -- it's an epidemic.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.12,0:01:15.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果尼维亚斯真那么在乎这场流行病的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, if Niveus was really worried about the epidemic,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.17,0:01:16.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就该免费提供疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'd be giving the vaccine out for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.02,0:01:18.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弄个新配方算怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This supposed new formula?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.76,0:01:20.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说这个会更快见效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they say it's faster-acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.25,0:01:22.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许是吧  但干嘛这周就进行人体试验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it is, but human trials this week?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.32,0:01:24.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  确实快了点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it does seem a little rushed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.05,0:01:25.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就快了"点儿"吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little rushed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.28,0:01:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有见到过新疫苗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you even seen the new vaccine?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.89,0:01:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没  - 我也没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Yeah. Neither have I.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.82,0:01:30.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我见过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.77,0:01:33.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.23,0:01:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要做个实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm running an experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.13,0:01:40.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.59,0:01:44.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张嘛  你也是实验的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax. You're part of it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.58,0:01:48.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.47,0:01:55.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  把门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, open this door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.73,0:02:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放开我  上帝啊  不要啊  放开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aah! Aah! Get off of me! God, no! Get off! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.53,0:02:11.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦  看起来起作用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, looks like it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.44,0:02:18.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第5季第20集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.60,0:02:31.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧瞧  我看起来像流行音乐之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out -- I look like the king of pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:32.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.90,0:02:32.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话题不和谐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:34.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来不太和谐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.28,0:02:36.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别误会  我很高兴疾病防治中心的人来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me wrong -- I'm glad the CDC is here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.98,0:02:38.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们最需要的还是疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but what we really need is vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.00,0:02:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.23,0:02:41.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先跟我说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.15,0:02:43.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有发现什么异常情况吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}have you noticed anything unusual about the strain --
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.48,0:02:45.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有行为变化的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any signs of behavioral change,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.39,0:02:46.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如侵袭什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}like aggression, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:47.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.01,0:02:49.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,流感患者有没有出现一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have the flu victims shown any signs of, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.95,0:02:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀人倾向\N{\fnArial\fs30}homicidal tendencies?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.18,0:02:56.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,种种迹象表明  我们这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Symptomatically speaking, we're looking at
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:02:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猪流感疫情相对来说并不严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}a relatively mild case of swine flu here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.29,0:03:02.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顶多就是一周都病怏怏的不能上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably add up to a miserable week off of work,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.61,0:03:03.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仅此而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:04.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是没任何异常咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So nothing unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.44,0:03:08.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一天半以前还没有任何病患\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day and a half ago, we didn't have a single case.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.24,0:03:09.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而现在却已经超过70例\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're looking at over 70 --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.54,0:03:12.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这传染速度也过于快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The infectious equivalent of a briefcase bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.51,0:03:14.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我就觉得这点不太正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, yeah, I might call that a little unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.33,0:03:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一天半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Day and a half?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.08,0:03:17.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同一时间  那些雕像也开始流泪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the same time those statues started crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.01,0:03:18.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.36,0:03:21.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.28,0:03:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚是不是说一堆雕像开始流泪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you just say a bunch of statues started crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.73,0:03:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  没有没有  谁会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why, no. No. W-who would --
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.02,0:03:27.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁会说那些啊  疯子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who would say that, huh? Crazy people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.86,0:03:28.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.46,0:03:29.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我们可正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, which we are not.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.28,0:03:30.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.39,0:03:33.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就  给我们拨些疫苗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just... get us some vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.71,0:03:47.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我猜猜先  又一堆热气腾腾的猪流感患者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me guess -- another steamin'-hot pile of swine flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.28,0:03:47.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:49.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本讲不通  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't make any sense, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.22,0:03:50.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瘟疫一定来过这儿  我敢肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pestilence touched down here. I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.20,0:03:53.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他为什么下手这么温柔  猪流感而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why is he dealing them soft serve like swine flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.29,0:03:54.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是有恶魔病毒在手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he's got the croatoan virus up his sleeve?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.99,0:03:55.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我猜不透\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I-I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.06,0:03:58.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管这狗娘养的心里打什么鬼主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't matter what the sick son of a bitch is doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:04:00.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重要的是这是他袭击第四座城了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What matters is this is the fourth town he's hit --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:03.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就我们所知的而已  我们还连他影都没追到\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we know of -- and we're still eating his dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.26,0:04:04.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们一点线索都没查到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.67,0:04:07.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们真没一点可能推测到他下一个目标吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got even a snowball at probable next target?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:09.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还没找到规律\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, no pattern we can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.27,0:04:11.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.40,0:04:12.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.17,0:04:20.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据我了解  他还是在继续向东走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, far as I can tell, he's still heading east,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.09,0:04:23.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  向东开吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}so... Head east, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.15,0:04:26.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-向东  - 向东\N{\fnArial\fs30}- East? - East?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.98,0:04:28.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  我们现在在内华达州西部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, we're in west Nevada.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.55,0:04:29.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,东边也微远了点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}East is practically all there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.31,0:04:31.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  你最好还是调头吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you better get to drivin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.22,0:04:36.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.59,0:04:38.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒是有个点子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.69,0:04:44.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得手了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.49,0:04:45.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想抽支烟谈谈心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fancy a fag and a chat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.00,0:04:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:53.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别那么急躁嘛  咱们应该先谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're upset. We should discuss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.19,0:04:54.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然地方不太对  但\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not here, but --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.59,0:04:55.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to talk? 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.74,0:04:56.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你对我们做了那些好事儿之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what you did to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.43,0:04:58.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对你们做什么了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}After what I -- what I did to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.80,0:04:59.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科尔特可是我给你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave you the colt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.78,0:05:01.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  而你也知道它对路西法根本没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and you knew it wouldn't work against the devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.80,0:05:03.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我压根就不知道  - 你骗了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I never! - You set us up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.83,0:05:06.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那场自杀式的袭击中我们失去了挚友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost people on that suicide run --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.84,0:05:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good people!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.62,0:05:10.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带谁去袭击是你们自己决定的  少赖我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who you take on the ride is your own business!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:14.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  情况仍旧没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, everything is still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.22,0:05:15.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们仍旧是一条战线上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-we're all still in this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:16.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.07,0:05:19.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托把你家这只狗狗叫走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call your dog off -- please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.92,0:05:22.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给个理由先\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me one good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.58,0:05:24.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能帮你们抓住瘟疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you pestilence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:27.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对瘟疫了解多少\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about pestilence?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.33,0:05:28.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道怎么找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how to get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.27,0:05:30.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这应该正是你们想要的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's got your interest, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.45,0:05:36.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你不会真相信他了吧  - 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you actually listening to this? - Sam --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.51,0:05:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你脑子进水了吧  - 安静会  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you friggin' nuts?! - Shut up for a second, sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.39,0:05:40.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩都给我闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, the both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.99,0:05:42.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look...I swear...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.14,0:05:44.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本以为科尔特能杀死他的  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought the colt would work. 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.90,0:05:45.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是无心之失\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an honest mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.88,0:05:47.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃一堑  长一智\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all part of the learning process.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:51.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但一切都没变  我仍想让路西法去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}But nothing's changed. I still want the devil dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.85,0:05:53.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来  还是有点改变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well... One thing's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.52,0:05:55.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在路西法知道我想让他去死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the devil knows that I want him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.68,0:05:56.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是我就成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.33,0:05:58.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有孩子里面麻烦最大的一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}makes me the most buggered son in all of creation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.76,0:05:59.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少来了  关我们什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap. We don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.14,0:06:02.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们烧了我的房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They burnt down my house!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.41,0:06:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还吃了我的裁缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}They ate my tailor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.46,0:06:09.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两个月来  我都苟且偷生  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Two months under a rock, 
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.74,0:06:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像是他妈的火蜥蜴\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a bloody salamander!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.71,0:06:14.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地上地下的恶魔们都在找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every demon on hell and earth's got his eyes out for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.51,0:06:17.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过  我出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet... here I am...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.31,0:06:20.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这个我最不该出现的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last place I should be --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.48,0:06:23.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这条路上  和温彻斯特兄弟说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the road, talking to Sam and Dean Winchester,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:25.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是在见鬼的聚光灯下\N{\fnArial\fs30}under a friggin' spotlight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:38.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我走吧  拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So come with me. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.82,0:06:45.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们到底要不要天启四骑士的戒指了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want the horsemen rings or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.08,0:06:49.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  我都知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I know all about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.95,0:06:50.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.21,0:07:06.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.68,0:07:08.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的逃命生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life on the lam.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.99,0:07:11.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虎落平阳啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the mighty have fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.29,0:07:13.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,单窗格玻璃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Single-pane glass,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.01,0:07:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连壁炉都要省着用\N{\fnArial\fs30}used contraception in the fireplace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.29,0:07:19.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,光是那些水渍\N{\fnArial\fs30}The water damage alone --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:20.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真为你心痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart's bleeding for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.83,0:07:22.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在说说你怎么知道戒指的事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, how do you know about the rings?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.27,0:07:24.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.51,0:07:27.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直密切关注着你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been keeping a close eye on you lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.33,0:07:29.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有魔法袋  恶魔找不到我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got hex bags. We're hidden from demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.62,0:07:30.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All but one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.11,0:07:33.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们闯入我家的那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That night you broke into my house,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.01,0:07:34.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是我们初次见面那回\N{\fnArial\fs30}our first date,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.27,0:07:37.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的侍从在你们车里藏了追踪装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}my valet hid a tracking device in your car --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.27,0:07:39.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个魔法硬币\N{\fnArial\fs30}a magical coin
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.26,0:07:41.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它能轻易敌过你们那小骨头魔法袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}that easily trumps your little bags o' bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.40,0:07:43.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也能让我听到你们的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}It allows me to hear things, too --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.29,0:07:47.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后  我被我听到的内容震惊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, my, the things I've heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:50.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们想把路西法关回牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you want to cram the devil back in the box?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.29,0:07:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狡猾的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cunning scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.81,0:07:55.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.25,0:07:59.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说能帮我们找到瘟疫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you could get us pestilence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.43,0:08:06.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道瘟疫他本尊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where pestilence is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.72,0:08:07.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Per se.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.92,0:08:11.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我知道哪个恶魔能告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do know the demon who does.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.72,0:08:16.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们可以称他为天启四骑士的马童\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's what you might call the horsemen's stable boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.14,0:08:20.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他为他们安排行程以及日常所需\N{\fnArial\fs30}He handles their itineraries, their personal needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.58,0:08:22.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  他就是你们要找的那位\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's who you want -- believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.81,0:08:25.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他能告诉我们小喷嚏的方位\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll tell us where sneezy's at.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.50,0:08:26.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么才能让他开口呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how do we get him to spill?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.88,0:08:27.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拔下他的脚趾甲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rip out his toenails?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.37,0:08:29.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.95,0:08:32.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他那种等级的疯子可不吃那一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nuts at his pay grade don't crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.25,0:08:34.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把他带到这里  然后我来出售他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We bring him here, then I sell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.38,0:08:35.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出售他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.53,0:08:38.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  我都向圣徒出售了几个世纪的罪恶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. I've sold sin to saints for centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道我还搞不定区区一个小恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think I can't close one little demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.86,0:08:44.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  那这个小恶魔在哪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so where's this demon of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.09,0:08:46.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(尼维亚斯)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.02,0:08:48.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想听到"还要几周"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to hear "Weeks."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.92,0:08:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想听到"只需几天"\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to hear "Days."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.36,0:08:53.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是这个实验还在测试中\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the lab isn't even finished testing yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.59,0:08:54.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实验的事用不着你操心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let me worry about the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.05,0:08:56.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  先生  您要求的分布范围\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, sir, you're asking for distribution
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.40,0:08:57.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在是规模空前\N{\fnArial\fs30}on an unprecedented scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.67,0:08:59.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  我们有一场前所未有的突发事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we have an unprecedented outbreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.83,0:09:04.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们国家正受到猪流感的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nation...is terrified of swine flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.36,0:09:08.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想要我们的疫苗  需要我们的疫苗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want our vaccine. They need our vaccine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.20,0:09:10.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这被称为"急需品"  同志们  \N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called "Demand," People. 
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.05,0:09:10.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就开始供应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, supply!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.22,0:09:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们已经尽全力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're doing our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.60,0:09:14.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经尽全力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're doing your best?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:15.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的尽全力了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing your best?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.03,0:09:18.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就比全力再多尽一份力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then do the best of somebody better!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.72,0:09:30.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您找我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.21,0:09:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米切尔  是的  进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mitchell, yes. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.32,0:09:36.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  布雷迪先生  我知道这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Mr. Brady, I know how important this is,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:38.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对于之前的态度  我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I-I'm sorry if I sounded --
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.52,0:09:39.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}No apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.59,0:09:43.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小米  我需要你这样的人才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mitch, I need people like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.09,0:09:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.95,0:09:45.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.06,0:09:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  在通讯部有个职位\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, there is a position in communications
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.03,0:09:52.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得非常适合你\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I think you would be perfect for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.47,0:09:54.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听起来很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.45,0:09:55.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确  你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is great. So what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.30,0:09:57.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你准备好加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready to enter
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.18,0:09:59.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竞争残酷的高层管理了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}the cutthroat world of upper management?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.60,0:10:00.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.53,0:10:01.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.26,0:10:08.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦你  别弄脏我的鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ooh. Watch the shoes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:13.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迟些再叫其他人来  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the rest later. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.07,0:10:25.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.14,0:10:29.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.84,0:10:31.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:52.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阁下  好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, great news.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.30,0:10:54.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疫苗的试验结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vaccine trials -- the results have been...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.09,0:10:56.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对足够荒唐\N{\fnArial\fs30}...really quite grotesque.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.10,0:10:58.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你会高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you'll be pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:00.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How soon?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.05,0:11:03.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鉴于如此大规模的分布  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Distribution on this scale -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.49,0:11:04.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要更多人手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we do need some humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.73,0:11:05.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没法对每个人都附身\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't possess them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.60,0:11:07.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想起那些所谓高层我就生气  我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And don't even get me started on the teamsters. I --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.14,0:11:12.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我会尽全力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'm doing my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.93,0:11:14.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.46,0:11:17.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比全力再多尽一份力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The best of someone better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.92,0:11:20.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:32.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么要听他的  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we even listening to him, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.27,0:11:34.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is totally insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.75,0:11:35.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't disagree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.42,0:11:39.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是个相亲相爱的家庭吧  好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One big happy family, are we, then? Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.86,0:11:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你准备好出发了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.03,0:11:43.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Yes. I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.07,0:11:45.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  你就乖乖看家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, keep the home fires burning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.91,0:11:46.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.40,0:11:48.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆不和我们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam's not coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:49.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why the hell not?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.71,0:11:50.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我不喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I don't like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.11,0:11:53.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust you...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.35,0:11:55.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  噢  对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And -- oh, yes --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.09,0:11:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一直都想杀死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep trying to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.03,0:12:00.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没门儿  我一定要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no damn way. This isn't gonna happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.78,0:12:02.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并没有问你  因为你并没有被邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking you, am I? 'cause you're not invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.14,0:12:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是在问你  怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking you. What's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.71,0:12:13.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:16.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好珍惜你们最后的日子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy your last few sunsets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.61,0:12:20.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.00,0:12:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.13,0:12:40.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能说什么  我相信他\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I say? I believe the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.12,0:13:03.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后迪恩和克劳力两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then Dean just walks...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.38,0:13:09.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...right out the door with Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.98,0:13:13.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  我对恶魔没有爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look, sam, I got no love for demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.53,0:13:15.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且  是啊  整件事情都很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, yeah, this whole thing is crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.62,0:13:18.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但  我也不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But...I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.65,0:13:20.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在一年的徒劳努力之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After a year of chasing up zilch,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.66,0:13:22.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许是时候发点小疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe it's time to go crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.69,0:13:24.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.74,0:13:29.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.28,0:13:31.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.94,0:13:34.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得你被附身那次吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that time you were possessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.56,0:13:36.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记忆犹新\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Rings a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当梅格让你杀死迪恩时  你没下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Meg told you to kill Dean, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:40.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你夺回了自己的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took your body back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.53,0:13:43.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是来得及给我自己一刀  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just long enough to shank myself, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.51,0:13:45.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  你是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.63,0:13:47.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的意思是  你是怎么让自己意识清醒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how'd you take back the wheel?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.15,0:13:51.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问这个干嘛  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you asking, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.98,0:13:56.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们能打开牢笼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say we can open the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.26,0:13:58.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  但然后又能如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. But then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.97,0:14:01.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们引诱路西法到牢笼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-we just lead the devil to the edge
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.27,0:14:02.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后让他自己跳进去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get him to jump in?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.45,0:14:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你难倒我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.53,0:14:05.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们引诱路西法到牢笼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you guys lead the devil to the edge
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.79,0:14:06.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我跳进去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I jump in?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:08.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.93,0:14:09.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就好比\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be just like
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:10.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时你拿刀刺向自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you turned the knife around on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.71,0:14:12.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就一下  一下就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}One action -- just one leap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:15.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你们俩个傻瓜是不是想气死我啊  - 鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you idjits trying to kill me?! - Bobby
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.31,0:14:17.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们刚刚才让你老哥悬崖勒马\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got done talking your brother off the ledge,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.50,0:14:18.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在又是你  排队等着说“同意”\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now you're lining up to say "Yes"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.11,0:14:20.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是你想的那样  只有你和迪恩都同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not like that. I'm not gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:22.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才会那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not unless we all agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.21,0:14:23.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这起码算是一个选择吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think we got to look at our options.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.57,0:14:25.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不在选择范围之内  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't an option, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.62,0:14:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何不呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.32,0:14:27.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.62,0:14:30.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种夺回意识的成功率微乎其微\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I did was a million-to-one,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.23,0:14:31.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且和我进行脑力搏击的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that was some pissant demon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.88,0:14:33.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是个小猫小狗的角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was brain-wrestling.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.39,0:14:33.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking about
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.09,0:14:36.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要从路西法手中夺回自己的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking back control from Satan himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.63,0:14:37.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  是的  是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.27,0:14:41.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.37,0:14:44.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,叫它“附身”是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called "Possession" For a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.64,0:14:46.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该最清楚不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, of all people, ought to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:48.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已足够强大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm strong enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:49.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.41,0:14:53.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会找出你的所有弱点  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna find every chink in your armor, Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.51,0:14:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后用其对抗你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And use it against you --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.99,0:14:57.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的恐惧  悲伤  愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your fear, your grief, your anger.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.19,0:14:58.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且实话实说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And let's face it --
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.16,0:15:00.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你对愤怒情绪的控制可并不怎么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not exactly Mr. Anger management.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.75,0:15:02.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你都控制不了自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you gonna control the devil
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:04.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又怎么能控制路西法呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you can't control yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.71,0:15:14.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:17.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  只是些人类肉盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah. Human shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.67,0:15:20.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个恶魔在顶层  十二楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demons are up top -- 12th floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.55,0:15:23.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:24.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须在楼后面找到一个入口\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have to find a way in through the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.25,0:15:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们温家的人总是化简为难吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You Winchesters make everything so complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.39,0:15:30.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.41,0:15:39.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.90,0:15:41.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我干  日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap! Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.05,0:15:46.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,门是开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Door's open!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.94,0:15:59.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.70,0:16:02.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.62,0:16:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时不我待\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on a tight schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.33,0:16:11.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.98,0:16:15.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你到傲娇起来了  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're squeamish? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.21,0:16:21.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上吧  猛男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get 'em, tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.60,0:16:24.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.51,0:16:27.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不了  上面不安全  那些都是恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. It's not safe up there. There's demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.21,0:16:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.24,0:16:29.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  只要按我说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just do what I told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.14,0:16:32.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,施展你的说服力\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-and try to be convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.49,0:16:34.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,效果绝对意想不到  相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll work like a charm. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.87,0:16:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.39,0:17:01.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  没有预约吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, no appointment?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.69,0:17:08.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是垂死挣扎的关头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of an 11th-hour thing, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.41,0:17:10.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你刚好准时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then, you're just on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.92,0:17:14.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.15,0:17:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你弟弟还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.38,0:17:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们来说正事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, down to business, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.32,0:17:36.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能为你做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.77,0:17:39.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上刚好相反  是我能为你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, it's about what I can do for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.61,0:17:40.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:43.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和萨姆干掉了你的两个伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Sam dropped two of your jockeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.51,0:17:44.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你知道此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.63,0:17:45.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我听说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. I got the memo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.28,0:17:49.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们拿了他们神秘且蕴含强大力量的戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we kept their, uh, secret power rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.22,0:17:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我来这儿的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.05,0:17:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听说你想要回它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard some folks saying that you wanted them back
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.68,0:17:56.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪怕会付出一些代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were willing to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.46,0:17:58.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.36,0:18:00.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.15,0:18:01.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.68,0:18:04.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你想要回它们  你就得跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you want them, you'll come with me --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.36,0:18:05.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不准动手动脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice and civil --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.39,0:18:06.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们先离开这座威廉古堡\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get out of your little batcave here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.24,0:18:08.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而后  我们商讨一下这笔交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we'll discuss a transaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.65,0:18:12.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁说我想要回那些戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who says I want them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.02,0:18:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啥\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:19.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁说我想要回那些戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who...Says... I want them?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.27,0:18:22.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个嘛...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.73,0:18:24.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别人说的呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.80,0:18:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.58,0:18:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,战争和饥荒\N{\fnArial\fs30}...war and famine,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.37,0:18:36.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使我再把戒指给他们戴上\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if I could cram the rings back on their bony fingers,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.10,0:18:39.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这恐怕也起不了多大作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt it would do much good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.82,0:18:42.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只剩干瘪的躯壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're withered husks right now --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.09,0:18:44.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像胎儿般蜷缩在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}fetal position on the floor --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.43,0:18:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都多亏了你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}all thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.03,0:18:50.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我根本不想要戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I don't want the rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.06,0:18:53.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I want is retribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.95,0:18:58.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就要给你点颜色看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna rip it right out of your ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.29,0:19:08.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这简直\N{\fnArial\fs30}This...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.39,0:19:11.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...is so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.35,0:19:14.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太痛快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Therapeutic, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.57,0:19:17.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你知道吗  我太感激你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Dean, I really owe you one, buddy,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.77,0:19:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I feel...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.05,0:19:20.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.69,0:19:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}much...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.46,0:19:24.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}better!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.80,0:19:41.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你跑去哪里啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.65,0:19:43.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别跑啊  我们才刚开始呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we're just getting started!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.33,0:20:27.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  又碰面了哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good meeting, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.86,0:20:29.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我非常兴奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.77,0:20:33.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大叔  晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evening, uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.30,0:20:46.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.28,0:20:48.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这太完美了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.84,0:20:50.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.99,0:20:53.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不想要戒指  他要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't want the rings. He wanted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.22,0:20:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,料到了你会大吃一惊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine the surprise on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.18,0:20:56.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.84,0:20:58.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的无知和误报\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your ignorance and misinformation --
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.60,0:20:59.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, completely authentic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.64,0:21:01.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个你不可能假装得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't fake that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.85,0:21:04.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么啦  进展很顺利啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I-it went like clockwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.27,0:21:06.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不觉得  你这个狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for me, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:10.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可结果就这样  谁叫你和恶魔合作呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you get -- working with a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.17,0:21:21.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  帅哥  小心我的坐垫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hot stuff, watch the upholstery!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.74,0:21:22.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的  伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up yours, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.01,0:21:27.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些刻印能够把他困住\N{\fnArial\fs30}This bit of carving will tie our friend here down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.65,0:21:29.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用杀掉  不用驱散\N{\fnArial\fs30}No zapping off, no smoking out --
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.65,0:21:30.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就把他困在肉身里\N{\fnArial\fs30}locked in the meat suit...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.95,0:21:33.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有利于我们跟他讨价还价\N{\fnArial\fs30}An important piece of our bargaining strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:38.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在从这上去  我们不走I-50道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, up here, we don't want I-50.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.23,0:21:39.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去93号路 往北方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take 93 north.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.86,0:21:41.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.40,0:21:43.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能带他到你弟弟那儿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we can't take this guy back to your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.83,0:21:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:50.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.21,0:21:52.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们之前认识  好了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got history, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.12,0:22:02.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想走就先老实交代\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to go anywhere, you start talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.59,0:22:03.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们什么关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}What history?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.31,0:22:31.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.25,0:22:35.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.88,0:22:39.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说前头  我很反对这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the record, I'm against this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.25,0:22:41.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关于高层人士变节的协商\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negotiating a high-level defection --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.22,0:22:43.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是非常棘手的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's very delicate business.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.66,0:22:49.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.06,0:22:50.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我求过迪恩不要回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I begged Dean not to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.70,0:22:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们本来应该远离你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should be miles away... from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.57,0:22:55.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他却华丽丽地对我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He replied with a colorful rejoinder
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.54,0:22:57.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关我屁事\N{\fnArial\fs30}about my "Corn Chute."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.71,0:23:02.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.38,0:23:05.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧  毁掉我们最后的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go -- ruin our last best hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.60,0:23:12.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是世界末日罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only the end of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.17,0:23:24.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.83,0:23:26.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.96,0:23:29.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都听我的  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to stay on mission, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.71,0:23:30.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,认真点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Focused.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.94,0:23:32.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不太明白  到底怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand. What's all this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.04,0:23:34.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这么做  是因为我信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing this 'cause I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.18,0:23:36.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,信任我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.01,0:23:37.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.18,0:23:40.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.04,0:23:51.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布雷迪 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Brady?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.76,0:23:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早就不是那个布雷迪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brady hasn't been Brady in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.85,0:24:01.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想想  大概是从大二期中开始  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Not since, oh... middle of our sophomore year?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.30,0:24:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.77,0:24:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个时候起就有恶魔瞄上你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a devil on your shoulder even back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.25,0:24:14.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  现在  真相大白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, now, let it all sink in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.85,0:24:16.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.45,0:24:18.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个狗娘养的  你介绍我和杰西认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch! You introduced me to Jess!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.92,0:24:20.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  我想他明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ding, ding! I think he's got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.66,0:24:22.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨姆  该死的  - 我要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn it, Sam! - I'm gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.23,0:24:31.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.67,0:24:34.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-让开  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of my way! - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.41,0:24:36.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  让开 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my way, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.87,0:24:38.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想赢的话  只有一条路走\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is only one way to win,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.21,0:24:39.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但杀了他没任何帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it ain't by killing that thing in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.68,0:24:42.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.34,0:24:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你们俩谈妥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}sounds like you got him nice and fluffed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.28,0:24:46.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由衷感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.09,0:24:48.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.59,0:24:51.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要瘟疫骑士的戒指来抓住路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need pestilence to get at the devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.42,0:24:53.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们要通过布雷迪来找到瘟疫骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we need Brady to get to pestilence.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.32,0:24:56.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  因为是克劳力说的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Because Crowley said so?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.33,0:24:57.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在得相信他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we trust him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.99,0:24:59.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像我信任露比一样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I trusted Ruby?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.26,0:25:01.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者像我曾经信任布雷迪那样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or like I trusted Brady back at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.14,0:25:13.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你自己算算这笔账\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look... do the math yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.91,0:25:15.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果路西法赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Lucifer wins,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.91,0:25:18.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会把这个地方变成他的天下\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll turn this place into his kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.45,0:25:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,覆巢之下\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the morningstar cleans house,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.08,0:25:22.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,岂有完卵\N{\fnArial\fs30}we all get the mop.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.59,0:25:26.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他创造了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He created us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.86,0:25:28.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛又要消灭我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he destroy us?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.86,0:25:30.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这根本说不通嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.99,0:25:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这得看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at who --
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.56,0:25:36.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他究竟是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.10,0:25:38.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后再看看我们又是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then take a look at what we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.04,0:25:40.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许你不用这么担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should be a little less worried
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.00,0:25:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的小命\N{\fnArial\fs30}about our necks
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.97,0:25:45.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多担心一下你自己吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And be a little more worried about yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.01,0:25:48.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想过  这不是重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has crossed my mind. That's not really the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.91,0:25:52.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力  实际上这才是重点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, crowley, that is the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.21,0:25:56.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人比你更了解被折磨的痛苦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one will know greater torment than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.69,0:26:00.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,路西法会永远折磨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer is never gonna let you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.06,0:26:04.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至于我  我心里有数\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for me, I know the score.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.69,0:26:08.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论是说或不说  我都死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dead, whether I tell you anything or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.60,0:26:12.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我决定光荣献身  多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I think I'll die on the winning side, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.90,0:26:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.34,0:26:19.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.09,0:26:38.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样  他接受你的建议没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how'd it go? He buy your girl scout cookies?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.23,0:26:39.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.66,0:26:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的麋鹿宝宝呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your moose?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.30,0:26:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他想冷静一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's cooling off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.74,0:26:48.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.60,0:26:49.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚他娘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get bent.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.40,0:26:51.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You going somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.67,0:26:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不肯低头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he won't budge,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.21,0:26:55.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我得出去探探风\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now I go stick my neck out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.91,0:26:59.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你准备怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.21,0:27:01.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虚张声势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly the kind of desperate swashbuckle
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.18,0:27:02.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我一向避免用这招\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been trying to avoid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.10,0:27:06.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我要去端了恶魔的窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I go kick open a hive of demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.16,0:27:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些戒指最好能起作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole bloody ring business better work.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.65,0:27:44.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.96,0:27:47.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.56,0:27:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam,  open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.45,0:27:53.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.78,0:28:04.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.18,0:28:08.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是要说遗言\N{\fnArial\fs30}We doing last words or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.62,0:28:10.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大二那年对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophomore year, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.65,0:28:16.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,布雷迪是个好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brady, here, he was a good kid --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.89,0:28:17.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正直坦率\N{\fnArial\fs30}Straight arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.06,0:28:19.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是你最好的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, your best friend, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.20,0:28:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完美的切入点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perfect point of access.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.18,0:28:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个感恩节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanksgiving.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.13,0:28:25.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.63,0:28:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得我放假回来那阵  放荡堕落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember when I came back from break all messed up --
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.67,0:28:30.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从医学预科退学  吸毒嫖妓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dropped out of pre-med, the drugs, the bitches?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.61,0:28:34.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是新的布雷迪  就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the new brady. That was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.68,0:28:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得多少次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember how much time you spent
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.85,0:28:40.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你试着劝我重回正轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to get me back on the right track?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.68,0:28:44.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是个好朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really were a good friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.66,0:28:49.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但黄眼恶魔送我回来不是为了交朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}But ol' yellow eyes didn't send me back to be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.39,0:28:51.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道你逐渐离我们远去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we could tell we were starting to lose you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.79,0:28:53.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成了一个温文尔雅的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were becoming a mild-mannered,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.33,0:28:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一文不值的窝囊废\N{\fnArial\fs30}worthless sack of piss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.56,0:28:58.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧  我们可不要那样的你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, come on. We couldn't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.43,0:29:00.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你曾经可是我们的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were our favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.34,0:29:04.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我用一个纯洁甜美的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I hooked you up
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.61,0:29:08.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无辜女孩来引你上钩\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a pure, sweet, innocent piece of tail.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.78,0:29:12.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我把她放到天花板上烤\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I toasted her on the ceiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.38,0:29:18.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿撒兹勒或许给了杰西卡致命一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right -- Azazel might have put the hit out on Jessica,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.65,0:29:21.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是  兄弟  是我享受了全过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, man, I got to have all the fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.69,0:29:27.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也以为我们是朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, she thought we were friends, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.26,0:29:28.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这么让我进门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.41,0:29:31.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她正在烤饼干\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was baking cookies.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.40,0:29:37.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我开始折磨她的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}she was so surprised...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.67,0:29:41.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她是如此的惊讶和痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}so hurt when I started in on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.54,0:29:42.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.91,0:29:44.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是这样能让你舒服点  下手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it if it'll make you feel better!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.21,0:29:48.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下手吧  小萨姆  快点下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it, Sammy! Do it! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.35,0:29:51.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.80,0:30:16.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.40,0:30:19.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey! All right! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.44,0:30:20.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上给你开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.31,0:30:25.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-发生什么了  - 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.31,0:30:27.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我自己有眼  - 迪恩  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My ass. - Dean, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.45,0:30:29.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  那布雷迪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? And what about Brady?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.75,0:30:32.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you said...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.94,0:30:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}...We need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.23,0:30:36.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  多艰苦的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}God. The day I've had.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.36,0:30:42.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.34,0:30:45.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以长命百岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to live forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.58,0:30:49.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.35,0:30:54.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去了个恶魔的巢穴  小开了下杀戒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Went over to a demons' nest -- had a little massacre.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.58,0:30:56.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜技术有点退步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be losing my touch, though --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.71,0:30:58.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留了一个活口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let one of the little toads live.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.49,0:31:00.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.42,0:31:04.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后还不小心说漏了嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also might have given said toad the impression
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.29,0:31:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说你昨晚你离开岗位\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you left your post last night
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.59,0:31:08.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you and I are --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.42,0:31:10.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好戏来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait for it --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.19,0:31:14.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是反撒旦联盟中的一对爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lovers in league against Satan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.77,0:31:22.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好哦  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.60,0:31:26.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以现在你不会死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, now death is off the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.74,0:31:29.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你上了老大的永世折磨者名单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you get to be on the boss's eternal-torment list
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.81,0:31:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和你亲爱的我一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}With little old me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.11,0:31:32.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  不  不  不  不  - 不 \N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no, no, no, no. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.75,0:31:34.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然除了我们的炽热激情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something else we have in common --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.91,0:31:37.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱俩还有其他的共同之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apart from our torrid passion, of course --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.08,0:31:38.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是胆小鬼的自我保护本能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Craven self-preservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.02,0:31:44.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  现在  告诉我瘟疫骑士在哪里吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, now, why don't you tell me where Pestilence is at?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.44,0:31:57.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, Growley.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.65,0:31:58.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是地狱猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that a hellhound?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.13,0:32:01.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.46,0:32:02.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会有地狱猎犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why was that a hellhound?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.00,0:32:05.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.70,0:32:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得我告诉过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember I was telling
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.40,0:32:07.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那个诡诈的跟踪装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}you about my crafty little tracking device?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.83,0:32:09.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.14,0:32:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔们在我身上放了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons planted one on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.08,0:32:13.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说地狱猎犬跟踪你到这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying a hellhound followed you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.57,0:32:15.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,严格来说  是跟踪这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, technically, he followed this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.11,0:32:16.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放我离开  我会说出你们想知道的所有事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me out of here. I'll tell you anything you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.65,0:32:18.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-闭嘴  - 那我们快逃\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up. - Okay, well, then we should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.98,0:32:21.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  同学们  没人比我更了解地狱猎犬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, boys. No one knows more about the hounds than I.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.65,0:32:23.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们早错过逃跑的时间点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're long past the point of "Go."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.35,0:32:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-该死  - 我早说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Damn it. - I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.19,0:32:32.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可真本事呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, well, good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.12,0:32:33.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸运的是  厨房里有盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luckily, we have salt in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.39,0:32:36.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看着布雷迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll watch Brady.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.40,0:32:38.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}watch me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.80,0:32:41.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我从这该死的地方放出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.80,0:33:14.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.30,0:33:19.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salt?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.34,0:33:24.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死  放我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it, get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.11,0:33:25.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.21,0:33:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.85,0:33:30.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.59,0:33:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're back?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.02,0:33:35.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算上我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm invested.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.72,0:33:36.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暂时如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Currently.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.20,0:33:38.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安分点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.26,0:33:41.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能控制它们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can control them?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.66,0:33:42.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只不算\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.43,0:33:47.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带了自己的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.73,0:33:48.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自家的比较狠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine's bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.37,0:33:51.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好孩子  干掉它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sic him, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.13,0:34:05.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.80,0:34:14.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.67,0:34:21.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我赌一千美金押我那只赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll wager $1,000 my pup wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.48,0:34:40.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  瘟疫骑士肯定在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I'm sure pestilence will be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.82,0:34:41.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.06,0:34:47.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.73,0:34:48.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,信得过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.56,0:34:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没理由撒谎吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got no reason to lie, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.87,0:34:56.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也说了  你我在同一条船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I said before, you're in my boat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.00,0:34:59.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你把我拉下水的  没的回头了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've screwed me -- for eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.46,0:35:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.64,0:35:03.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没这么夸张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't last that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.41,0:35:04.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.04,0:35:07.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.25,0:35:10.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to do you a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.82,0:35:15.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时再联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect we'll be in touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.78,0:35:41.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.64,0:35:43.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使和恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}All those angels, all those demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.02,0:35:45.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些个狗杂种们\N{\fnArial\fs30}all those sons of bitches --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.79,0:35:47.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们怎么就是不懂呢  小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}they just don't get it, do they, Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.99,0:35:50.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  他们是不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they don't, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.98,0:35:52.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要知道  布雷迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Brady...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.69,0:35:54.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该害怕我们才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're the ones you should be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.60,0:36:03.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你这回是来真的  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet this is a real moment for you, big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.20,0:36:06.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这会让你好过点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna make you feel all better?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.91,0:36:08.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只是开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.11,0:36:13.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,曾被我们牵着鼻子走  现在要弥补吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna make up for all the times that we yanked your chain --
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.05,0:36:16.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黄眼恶魔  露比和我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yellow eyes, Ruby, me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.35,0:36:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能全怪我们头上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it wasn't all our fault, was it? No, no, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.65,0:36:21.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自己选择相信我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who trusted us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.29,0:36:23.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们走进你的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one who let us into your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.29,0:36:27.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任由我们一再地在你耳边低语\N{\fnArial\fs30}let us whisper in your ear over and over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.49,0:36:29.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有想过原因吗  小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever wonder why that is, Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.76,0:36:32.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我们总能找到你的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever wonder why we were so in your blind spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.51,0:36:37.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或许是因为我们流着相同的血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's because we got the same stuff in our veins
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.17,0:36:42.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你的内心深处  你知道我们是同类\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, deep down, you know you're just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.49,0:36:57.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你之所以这么憎恨我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you hate us so much because you hate what you see
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.62,0:36:59.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实是在憎恨你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}every time you look in the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.16,0:37:00.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就没想过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever think of that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.56,0:37:06.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我们恶魔唯一的区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the only difference between you and a demon...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.93,0:37:09.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过是你生活在人间\N{\fnArial\fs30}is your hell is right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.22,0:37:28.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.40,0:37:48.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查到了一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, followed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.38,0:37:50.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全是凶兆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nasty omens,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.94,0:37:53.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但都和死亡骑士无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}but none of it's death with a capital "D."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.45,0:37:58.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事给我打电话就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, just give me a ring if it turns into anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.05,0:38:00.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卢法斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, Rufus...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.34,0:38:03.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}you watch your ass out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.73,0:38:07.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别灰心  援兵来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chin up. Cavalry's arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.20,0:38:11.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Charming.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.89,0:38:13.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那伤不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That won't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.14,0:38:15.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Name's Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.77,0:38:16.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能你已经\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you've...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.91,0:38:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就是克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.82,0:38:18.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这肉身\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the flesh --
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.68,0:38:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是个在纽约还算成功的文稿代理人\N{\fnArial\fs30}of a moderately successful literary agent out of New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.22,0:38:31.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来你听说过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you have heard of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.89,0:38:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人家很喜欢这套西装的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked this suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.21,0:38:35.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来这干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.30,0:38:36.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给自己找条出路咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking out for Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.72,0:38:37.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning...?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.75,0:38:42.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,温家兄弟在找第三只戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boys are on to ring number 3,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.14,0:38:44.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们还差第四只\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we still need number 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.19,0:38:47.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来助他们一臂之力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.52,0:38:52.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道死亡骑士在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know where death is?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.13,0:38:58.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  毫无头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Haven't the foggiest.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.73,0:39:04.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就给我滚出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then get the hell off my property
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.10,0:39:06.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不然我用石盐炸了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}before I blast you so full of rock salt,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.44,0:39:07.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这死娘娘腔\N{\fnArial\fs30}you crap margaritas.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.97,0:39:09.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别忙着举枪对付我\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a mite unfriendly,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.57,0:39:11.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有这功夫闹脾气\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing as I could be getting you death's location
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.91,0:39:13.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就能告诉你死亡骑士在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}in about the time it'd take you to reload.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.98,0:39:15.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是想从恶魔口中套出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just gonna chat some demons up
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.05,0:39:17.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们可都认得你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hope they don't recognize you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.02,0:39:19.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然不  那岂不是送死\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, no. That could get me killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.95,0:39:24.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我知道一个小咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there is this little spell that I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.22,0:39:25.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That so?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.69,0:39:27.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定有效\N{\fnArial\fs30}Results are 100% guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.79,0:39:30.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你还和我绕什么弯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Then why are you snake-oiling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.92,0:39:36.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说起来有点尴尬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's a little bit...embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.60,0:39:39.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一个技术性问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's this... technicality.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.61,0:39:44.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要让这奇妙的事发生  有样东西必不可少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a little something to get the magic going.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.54,0:39:46.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.72,0:39:48.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你许一个愿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make a wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.41,0:39:50.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以满足你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you anything you want, mate --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.48,0:39:53.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然也包括死亡骑士的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}up to and including death's coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.28,0:39:54.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I need is...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.52,0:39:56.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}My soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.39,0:39:57.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可做过不少贡献呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done more with less.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.06,0:40:00.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说吧  歌手们获得格莱美奖时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just say when they're getting their Grammys,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.19,0:40:01.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,功劳可不是上帝一个人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}they shouldn't all be thanking god.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.53,0:40:05.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  这交易很划算\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth it, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.46,0:40:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.27,0:40:13.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.41,0:40:15.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's my counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.88,0:40:21.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真天杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bloody hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.15,0:40:22.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脾气真大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feisty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.15,0:40:24.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.45,0:40:26.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就会还给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give it right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.58,0:40:28.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我是傻子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm a natural-born idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.89,0:40:30.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正好相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite the contrary.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.32,0:40:33.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  你是该有所怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're right to be suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.09,0:40:34.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我是你的盟友\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm your ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.94,0:40:37.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有共同的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enemy of my enemy and all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.83,0:40:40.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要把路西法封印回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need the devil back in his stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.13,0:40:43.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这其实关系到我的切身利益\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, my delicate ass depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.91,0:40:50.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我保证只是暂时借用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you -- temporary loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.31,0:40:54.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会马上还给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give it... Right...Back.
